From: Artzig contributors
Subject: [PATCH] MediaMetrics JNI: use a portable const registration table

Upstream Clang rejects function-pointer to void-pointer conversions in constant
expressions. The JNI table only needs immutable static storage. Keep its entries
and registration unchanged while dropping the constexpr requirement.

--- a/media/jni/android_media_MediaMetricsJNI.cpp
+++ b/media/jni/android_media_MediaMetricsJNI.cpp
@@ -222,7 +222,7 @@
 
 // ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
-static constexpr JNINativeMethod gMethods[] = {
+static const JNINativeMethod gMethods[] = {
     {"native_submit_bytebuffer", "(Ljava/nio/ByteBuffer;I)I",
             (void *)android_media_MediaMetrics_submit_bytebuffer},
 };
